Licence for the files in viewer/data/

The files in this directory are derived from the ETH3D benchmark data
(https://www.eth3d.net), which is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License. The derived
files are therefore released under the same licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

What is here, per scene (office, delivery_area):

  images/            Downscaled (800 px wide) JPEG copies of the ETH3D DSLR photos.
  points.f32 ...     Sparse 3D points from a COLMAP reconstruction of those photos,
                     with colours taken from the photos.
  labels.u8,
  confidence.u8,
  instances.i16      Per-point structure labels, confidences and instance ids computed
                     by the code in this repository.
  obs_*              The 2D keypoints of each photo that were triangulated into 3D.
  meta.json          Camera poses, fitted planes, quality gates and decision log.

Attribution: original data by T. Schops, J. L. Schonberger, S. Galliani,
T. Sattler, K. Schindler, M. Pollefeys and A. Geiger, "A Multi-View Stereo
Benchmark with High-Resolution Images and Multi-Camera Videos", CVPR 2017.
Changes: photos downscaled and re-encoded; points reconstructed from the photos;
labels and confidences added; coordinates rotated, scaled and centred.

You may share and adapt this material for non-commercial purposes if you give
this credit, indicate changes, and distribute your contributions under the same
licence. The MIT licence in the repository root applies to the code only.
